                                                "sense_id": "c42e5438-736b-32fc-9159-ba152bddf1ec",
                                                "text": "His uncle, a Cardinal, engages a Spanish youth of Moorish descent called Diego, an expert singer and player on the virginal, to unlock the secrets of the heart, and to cleanse his bosom of the perilous stuff, and cure him by the spell of his music."
